+# Semver-Bump
+
+A CLI tool that increments semantic versions in files.
+
+Supports major, minor, patch, and prerelease bumps. Automatically detects version strings in package.json, Cargo.toml, pyproject.toml, and any file containing semantic version patterns.
+
+## Features
+
+- Bump major, minor, patch, or prerelease versions
+- Set a specific version with `-v`
+- Auto-detect current version from file
+- Dry run mode to preview changes
+- Update multiple files at once
+- Single binary, no dependencies
+
+## Installation
+
+### From source
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/semver-bump@latest
+```
+
+### Build manually
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/semver-bump.git
+cd semver-bump
+go build -o semver-bump .
+cp semver-bump /usr/local/bin/
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+semver-bump [options] <file...>
+```
+
+### Options
+
+| Flag | Description |
+|------|-------------|
+| `-b TYPE` | Bump type: major, minor, patch, prerelease (default: patch) |
+| `-v VER` | Set specific version instead of bumping |
+| `-n` | Dry run: show what would change |
+| `-c VER` | Current version (auto-detected if not specified) |
+
+### Examples
+
+```bash
+# Bump patch version (1.2.3 -> 1.2.4)
+semver-bump package.json
+
+# Bump minor version (1.2.3 -> 1.3.0)
+semver-bump -b minor package.json
+
+# Bump major version (1.2.3 -> 2.0.0)
+semver-bump -b major package.json
+
+# Set specific version
+semver-bump -v 2.0.0 package.json
+
+# Dry run to preview changes
+semver-bump -n -b patch package.json
+
+# Update multiple files
+semver-bump -b minor package.json Cargo.toml pyproject.toml
+
+# Bump prerelease (1.0.0 -> 1.0.0-0)
+semver-bump -b prerelease package.json
+```
+
+## Version Format
+
+Follows [Semantic Versioning 2.0.0](https://semver.org/):
+
+- `MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH` (e.g., `1.2.3`)
+- Pre-release: `1.0.0-alpha.1`
