+# yaml-lint
+
+Check YAML syntax and style. Validates YAML files for syntax errors and common style issues like trailing whitespace, tab indentation, and unquoted keys.
+
+## Features
+
+- YAML syntax validation
+- Trailing whitespace detection
+- Tab indentation warnings (YAML recommends spaces)
+- Line length checks
+- Consecutive empty lines detection
+- Mixed tabs and spaces warnings
+- Unquoted keys with special characters
+- File ends with newline check
+- Multiple output formats: text, JSON, GitHub Actions
+- Read from files or stdin
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/yaml-lint@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/yaml-lint.git
+cd yaml-lint
+go build -o yaml-lint .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+yaml-lint [flags] [file...]
+cat file.yaml | yaml-lint [flags]
+```
+
+### Flags
+
+| Flag | Description |
+|------|-------------|
+| `-s, --strict` | Treat warnings as errors |
+| `--style` | Only check style, not syntax |
+| `--no-trailing` | Skip trailing whitespace check |
+| `--allow-tabs` | Allow tab indentation |
+| `--max-line-len N` | Max line length (0 to disable) |
+| `--no-quote-check` | Skip key quoting checks |
+| `-q, --quiet` | Suppress success message |
+| `-f, --format fmt` | Output format: `text` (default), `json`, `github` |
+| `-h, --help` | Show help |
+
+## Examples
+
+### Basic syntax check
+
+```bash
+yaml-lint config.yaml
+```
+
+### Strict mode (warnings become errors)
+
+```bash
+yaml-lint --strict *.yml
+```
+
+### JSON output for CI pipelines
+
+```bash
+yaml-lint -f json deployment.yaml
+```
+
+### GitHub Actions format
+
+```bash
+yaml-lint -f github *.yaml
+```
+
