-### `POST /diff`
+## API
 
-Compare two texts and return structured diff.
+### POST /diff
+
+Compare two texts and return the diff.
+
+**Request body:**
+
+| Field | Type | Required | Description |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `old` | string | yes* | The original text |
+| `new` | string | yes* | The modified text |
+| `old_file` | string | no | Name for the old file in diff output (default: `a`) |
+| `new_file` | string | no | Name for the new file in diff output (default: `b`) |
+
+*At least one of `old` or `new` must be non-empty.
+
+**Response:**
+
+| Field | Type | Description |
+|---|---|---|
+| `unified_diff` | string | The unified diff output (empty if no differences) |
+| `has_diff` | boolean | `true` if differences were found |
+| `summary` | string | Human-readable summary |
+
