+# quick-survey
+
+Create and analyze quick surveys from the command line. Perfect for team polls, quick decisions, and gathering opinions without leaving the terminal.
+
+## Features
+
+- Create surveys with multiple choice options
+- Support for single and multiple choice surveys
+- Interactive voting with numbered options
+- Visual results with progress bars
+- List all surveys with vote counts
+- Delete surveys when done
+- JSON-based storage (portable, human-readable)
+
+## Installation
+
+### From Source
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/quick-survey/cmd/quick-survey@latest
+```
+
+### Build Locally
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/quick-survey.git
+cd quick-survey
+go build -o quick-survey ./cmd/quick-survey/
+```
+
+### Docker
+
+```bash
+docker build -t quick-survey .
+docker run --rm quick-survey --help
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+### Create a Survey
+
+```bash
+# Single choice
+quick-survey create "Favorite language" --options "Go,Python,Rust,Java"
+
+# Multiple choice
+quick-survey create "Pick toppings" --options "Pepperoni,Mushrooms,Olives,Jalapeños" --multi
+```
+
+### List Surveys
+
+```bash
+quick-survey list
+```
+
+### Vote
+
+```bash
+# Single choice
+quick-survey vote my-survey-id 1
+
+# Multiple choice
+quick-survey vote my-survey-id 1,3
+```
+
+### View Results
+
+```bash
+quick-survey results my-survey-id
+```
+
+### Delete a Survey
+
+```bash
+quick-survey delete my-survey-id
+```
+
+## Examples
