 # tcp-dump-lite
 
-A lightweight network traffic capture and analysis tool. View active connections, monitor bandwidth, and scan ports — all from the command line.
+A lightweight network connection monitor and analyzer for Linux. Reads from `/proc/net` — no root required.
 
 ## Features
 
