-- **Connection summary** — Visual breakdown of connection states with bar chart
-- **Interface stats** — Network interface traffic statistics (RX/TX bytes and packets)
-- **Bandwidth monitor** — Real-time bandwidth monitoring with configurable duration
-- **Port scanner** — Scan open ports on a host with batch processing
-- **Filtering** — Filter connections by IP, port, or state
+- **Snapshot** — View all active TCP/UDP connections at a glance
+- **Monitor** — Continuously watch connections with configurable interval
+- **Top flows** — Rank connections by data transferred
+- **Filter** — By IP address or protocol (TCP/UDP)
+- **No root** — Reads from `/proc/net/tcp` and `/proc/net/udp`
 
