+# nginx-gen
+
+Generate nginx configuration files from simple YAML.
+
+## Features
+
+- **YAML input** — Write clean, readable config instead of nginx syntax
+- **Reverse proxy** — Define upstream proxies with proper headers
+- **SSL/TLS** — Configure HTTPS with certificate paths
+- **Static files** — Serve static content with root/index directives
+- **Redirections** — HTTP to HTTPS redirects and custom return codes
+- **Validation** — Check your YAML before generating
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/nginx-gen.git
+cd nginx-gen
+go build -o nginx-gen .
+```
+
+Or install globally:
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/nginx-gen@latest
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+nginx-gen <command> [arguments]
+```
+
+### Commands
+
+| Command | Description |
+|---------|-------------|
+| `generate <config.yaml> [output.conf]` | Generate nginx.conf from YAML |
+| `validate <config.yaml>` | Validate a YAML config file |
+| `example` | Print an example YAML config |
+| `help` | Show help message |
+
+## Examples
+
+### Generate from YAML
+
+```bash
+nginx-gen generate site.yaml
+nginx-gen generate site.yaml /etc/nginx/sites-available/myapp.conf
+```
+
+### Validate config
+
+```bash
+nginx-gen validate site.yaml
+```
+
+### Get example template
+
+```bash
+nginx-gen example > template.yaml
+```
+
+## YAML Configuration
+
+```yaml
+http:
+  servers:
+    - listen: 80
+      server_name: example.com
+      access_log: /var/log/nginx/example.access.log
+      error_log: /var/log/nginx/example.error.log
+      routes:
+        - path: /
+          proxy_pass: http://localhost:3000
+        - path: /api
+          proxy_pass: http://localhost:8080
+        - path: /static
