+# git-blame-stats
+
+Code ownership statistics from `git blame`. Shows which authors contributed the most lines across a codebase.
+
+## Features
+
+- Aggregate `git blame` data across all files in a directory
+- Filter by file extension (`--ext=.go`, `--ext=.ts`, etc.)
+- Configurable number of top authors (`--top=N`)
+- Shows author name, email, file count, line count, and percentage share
+- Skips `.git`, `node_modules`, and `vendor` directories automatically
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/git-blame-stats@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/git-blame-stats.git
+cd git-blame-stats
+go build -o git-blame-stats .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+git-blame-stats [options] [DIR]
+```
+
+### Options
+
+| Flag | Description |
+|------|-------------|
+| `--ext=.go` | Only analyze files with this extension |
+| `--top=N` | Show top N authors (default: 10) |
+| `--all` | Show all authors |
+| `-h, --help` | Show help message |
+
+### Examples
+
+**Stats for current directory:**
+```bash
+git-blame-stats .
+```
+
+**Only Go files:**
+```bash
+git-blame-stats --ext=.go ./src
+```
+
+**Top 5 contributors:**
+```bash
+git-blame-stats --top=5 .
+```
+
+**All TypeScript authors:**
+```bash
+git-blame-stats --all --ext=.ts ./project
+```
+
+### Output
+
+```
+AUTHOR                       EMAIL                 FILES    LINES  SHARE
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+Alice Dev                    alice@example.com         12     3450  45.2%
+Bob Smith                    bob@example.com            8     2100  27.6%
+Carol Wu                     carol@example.com          5     1200  15.8%
+
+total: 25 files, 7630 lines
+```
+
+## Requirements
+
+- Go 1.21+
