+# deploy-cli
+
+Simple deployment tool with rollback support. Run pre-deploy checks, execute deployment commands, run post-deploy hooks, and rollback to any previous version — all from the terminal.
+
+## Features
+
+- **Deploy pipeline**: pre-deploy → deploy → post-deploy hooks
+- **Rollback**: revert to the previous successful deployment or a specific version
+- **History**: track all deployments with timestamps, versions, and status
+- **Config-driven**: single YAML file to define your entire deployment workflow
+- **Zero dependencies**: single binary, works anywhere
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/deploy-cli@latest
+```
+
+Or download the binary from [releases](https://github.com/TataneSan/deploy-cli/releases).
+
+## Quick Start
+
+```bash
+# Create a config file
+deploy-cli init
+
+# Edit deploy.yaml to match your setup
+
+# Deploy
+deploy-cli deploy --version 1.0.0 --commit abc1234
+
+# Check status
+deploy-cli status
+
+# View history
+deploy-cli history
+
+# Rollback to previous version
+deploy-cli rollback
+```
+
+## Configuration
+
+Run `deploy-cli init` to generate a `deploy.yaml`:
+
+```yaml
+app: myapp
+environment: production
+
+source:
+  type: local
+  path: ./build
+
+target:
+  type: local
+  path: /var/www/myapp
+
+pre_deploy:
+  - echo "Running pre-deploy checks..."
+  - npm test
+
+deploy:
+  - rsync -avz ./build/ /var/www/myapp/
+  - systemctl restart myapp
+
+post_deploy:
+  - curl -f http://localhost:8080/health || exit 1
+  - echo "Deployment complete"
+
+rollback:
+  - systemctl reload myapp
+
+retain: 10
+```
+
+### Target Types
+
+| Type    | Description                          | Required Fields        |
