+# cli-dictionary
+
+A fast, lightweight command-line dictionary and thesaurus tool written in Go. Look up definitions, synonyms, and antonyms directly from your terminal.
+
+## Features
+
+- **Definitions**: Look up word definitions with part-of-speech grouping
+- **Synonyms**: Find synonyms for any word
+- **Antonyms**: Find antonyms for any word
+- **Full Lookup**: Get definitions, synonyms, antonyms, and phonetics in one command
+- **Multi-word support**: Look up phrases and compound words
+- **Fast**: Single binary, no dependencies, instant startup
+
+## Installation
+
+### From Source
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/cli-dictionary@latest
+```
+
+### Build Manually
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/cli-dictionary.git
+cd cli-dictionary
+go build -o cli-dictionary .
+sudo mv cli-dictionary /usr/local/bin/
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+cli-dictionary <command> <word>
+```
+
+### Commands
+
+| Command | Aliases | Description |
+|---------|---------|-------------|
+| `define` | `def` | Show definitions for a word |
+| `synonyms` | `syn` | Show synonyms for a word |
+| `antonyms` | `ant` | Show antonyms for a word |
+| `lookup` | `look` | Show full entry (definitions, synonyms, antonyms) |
+| `help` | `-h` | Show help message |
+| `version` | `-v` | Show version |
+
+### Examples
+
+```bash
+# Look up a definition
+cli-dictionary define hello
+
+# Quick definition with alias
+cli-dictionary def programming
+
+# Find synonyms
+cli-dictionary syn beautiful
+
+# Find antonyms
+cli-dictionary ant happy
+
+# Full word entry
+cli-dictionary lookup freedom
+
+# Multi-word phrases
+cli-dictionary define "state of the art"
+```
+
+### Example Output
+
+```
+$ cli-dictionary define hello
+
+Definitions for 'hello':
+
+  [interjection]
+
