+# time-tracker
+
+A lightweight command-line time tracking tool with SQLite persistence. Track time spent on projects and tasks, view history, and generate reports.
+
+## Features
+
+- **Start/Stop tracking**: Simple start and stop commands for time entries
+- **Project support**: Organize entries by project
+- **History**: View past entries with optional project filtering
+- **Reports**: Time breakdown by task with visual bar charts
+- **JSON output**: Export history as JSON for further processing
+- **Persistent storage**: SQLite database stored in `~/.time-tracker.db`
+
+## Installation
+
+### From Source
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/time-tracker@latest
+```
+
+### Build Manually
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/time-tracker.git
+cd time-tracker
+go build -o time-tracker .
+sudo mv time-tracker /usr/local/bin/
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+time-tracker <command> [options]
+```
+
+### Commands
+
+| Command | Description |
+|---------|-------------|
+| `start [TASK]` | Start tracking time for a task |
+| `stop` | Stop the current tracking session |
+| `status` | Show currently active entry |
+| `history [options]` | Show past entries |
+| `projects` | List all projects |
+| `report [options]` | Show time report with breakdown |
+| `delete ID` | Delete an entry by ID |
+| `help` | Show help message |
+| `version` | Show version |
+
+### Options
+
+#### start
+- `--project NAME` — Set project name
+- `--task TASK` — Set task description
+
+#### history
+- `--project NAME` — Filter by project
+- `--limit N` — Number of entries (default: 20)
+- `--json` — Output as JSON
+
+#### report
+- `--project NAME` — Filter by project
+- `--period P` — Period: `day`, `week`, `month`, `all` (default: `week`)
+
+### Examples
+
+```bash
+# Start tracking a task
+time-tracker start Working on login page
+
+# Start with project
+time-tracker start --project website --task Fix CSS bugs
+
+# Check current status
+time-tracker status
+
+# Stop tracking
