+# httpbin-cli
+
+Local HTTP test server. Simulates various HTTP responses, methods, status codes, delays, and headers for testing clients and APIs.
+
+## Features
+
+- All HTTP methods (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, PATCH, HEAD, OPTIONS)
+- Configurable status codes
+- Response delays (simulated latency)
+- Request echo (headers, body, method, query params)
+- Basic authentication testing
+- CORS support
+- JSON and plain text responses
+- Request logging
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/httpbin-cli@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/httpbin-cli.git
+cd httpbin-cli
+go build -o httpbin-cli .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+httpbin-cli [flags]
+```
+
+### Flags
+
+| Flag | Description | Default |
+|------|-------------|---------|
+| `--host` | Bind address | `127.0.0.1` |
+| `--port` | Bind port | `8080` |
+| `--status` | Default status code | `200` |
+| `--delay` | Response delay (e.g. 500ms, 1s) | `0s` |
+| `--body` | Static response body | `""` |
+| `--json` | Return JSON response | `false` |
+| `--basic-auth` | Enable basic auth (user:pass) | `""` |
+| `--cors` | Enable CORS headers | `false` |
+| `--silent` | Suppress request logs | `false` |
+
+### Examples
+
+Start a basic server on port 8080:
+```bash
+httpbin-cli
+```
+
+Start with a 500ms delay:
+```bash
+httpbin-cli --delay 500ms
+```
+
+Return a 404 status:
+```bash
+httpbin-cli --status 404
+```
+
+Enable basic auth:
+```bash
+httpbin-cli --basic-auth admin:secret
+```
+
+Enable CORS:
+```bash
+httpbin-cli --cors
+```
+
+Custom host and port:
+```bash
