+# counter-api
+
+A simple incremental counter API with reset functionality. Useful for testing stateful endpoints, load testing, and tracking request counts.
+
+## Features
+
+- Named counters with atomic increment/decrement
+- Get current count
+- Reset counters
+- Set counter to specific value
+- List all counters
+- In-memory storage with thread-safe access
+- CORS support
+- JSON responses
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/counter-api@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/counter-api.git
+cd counter-api
+go build -o counter-api .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+counter-api [flags]
+```
+
+### Flags
+
+| Flag | Description | Default |
+|------|-------------|---------|
+| `--host` | Bind address | `127.0.0.1` |
+| `--port` | Bind port | `8080` |
+| `--cors` | Enable CORS headers | `false` |
+| `--silent` | Suppress request logs | `false` |
+
+### Examples
+
+```bash
+counter-api
+counter-api --host 0.0.0.0 --port 3000 --cors
+```
+
+## Endpoints
+
+| Method | Path | Description |
+|--------|------|-------------|
+| GET | `/` | List all counters |
+| GET | `/counter/:name` | Get counter value |
+| POST | `/counter/:name/increment` | Increment counter by 1 |
+| POST | `/counter/:name/decrement` | Decrement counter by 1 |
+| POST | `/counter/:name/set/:value` | Set counter to specific value |
+| DELETE | `/counter/:name` | Reset/delete counter |
+| DELETE | `/counter` | Reset all counters |
+
+## Testing
+
+```bash
+# Increment counter
+curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/counter/page_views/increment
+
+# Get counter value
+curl http://localhost:8080/counter/page_views
+
+# Decrement
+curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/counter/page_views/decrement
+
+# Set specific value
+curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/counter/page_views/set/100
+
