 ```
 
 ## Usage
 
 ```bash
-# Filter errors
-log-filter -i "ERROR" app.log
+# Filter a log file
+log-filter app.log
 
-# Multiple patterns
-log-filter -i "ERROR" -i "FATAL" -e "healthcheck" app.log
+# Filter by level
+log-filter app.log --level ERROR
+log-filter app.log -l WARN
 
