+# Docker PS Extended
+
+Extended `docker ps` with disk usage and environment variables. Shows more information about your containers in a clean table format.
+
+## Features
+
+- Shows container name, image, status, ports, and size
+- Display environment variables per container
+- Show disk usage details
+- Filter containers by name or image
+- JSON output support
+- Colored status indicators (green=running, red=stopped, yellow=restarting)
+- Summary line with running/stopped counts
+
+## Installation
+
+```bash
+# Global install
+npm install -g docker-ps-extended
+
+# Or local install
+npm install docker-ps-extended
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+# Show running containers
+docker-ps-extended
+
+# Show all containers (including stopped)
+docker-ps-extended --all
+
+# Show environment variables
+docker-ps-extended --env
+
+# Show disk usage
+docker-ps-extended --disk
+
+# Show all with env and disk
+docker-ps-extended --all --env --disk
+
+# Filter by name or image
+docker-ps-extended --filter nginx
+
+# JSON output
+docker-ps-extended --json
+
+# Disable colors
+docker-ps-extended --no-color
+```
+
+## Options
+
+| Option | Short | Description |
+|--------|-------|-------------|
+| `--all` | `-a` | Show all containers (including stopped) |
+| `--env` | `-e` | Show environment variables |
+| `--disk` | `-d` | Show disk usage details |
+| `--filter <str>` | `-f` | Filter containers by name/image |
+| `--no-color` | | Disable colored output |
+| `--json` | | Output as JSON |
+| `--help` | `-h` | Show help |
+
+## Examples
+
+### Quick overview
+```bash
+docker-ps-extended
+```
+
+### Debug a container's environment
+```bash
+docker-ps-extended --filter myapp --env
+```
+
+### Check disk usage
+```bash
