+# cli-pomodoro
+
+Pomodoro timer with sound notifications for the terminal.
+
+## Features
+
+- Configurable work, short break, and long break durations
+- Multiple rounds per cycle with long break after each cycle
+- Optional cycle limit
+- Sound notifications (terminal bell)
+- Real-time countdown display
+- Ctrl+C to stop early
+- No external dependencies
+
+## Installation
+
+### From source
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/cli-pomodoro@latest
+```
+
+### Build manually
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/cli-pomodoro.git
+cd cli-pomodoro
+go build -o cli-pomodoro .
+sudo mv cli-pomodoro /usr/local/bin/
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+cli-pomodoro [OPTIONS]
+```
+
+### Options
+
+| Flag | Description | Default |
+|------|-------------|---------|
+| `-w, --work MINUTES` | Work duration in minutes | `25` |
+| `-s, --short MINUTES` | Short break duration | `5` |
+| `-l, --long MINUTES` | Long break duration | `15` |
+| `-n, --rounds NUMBER` | Rounds before long break | `4` |
+| `-c, --cycles NUMBER` | Total cycles (0 = unlimited) | `0` |
+| `--no-sound` | Disable sound notifications | `false` |
+| `--no-progress` | Disable progress bar | `false` |
+| `--version` | Show version | - |
+| `-h, --help` | Show help | - |
+
+### Examples
+
+Default session (25/5/15, 4 rounds, unlimited cycles):
+```bash
+cli-pomodoro
+```
+
+Custom durations:
+```bash
+cli-pomodoro -w 50 -s 10 -l 20
+```
+
+3 rounds per cycle, 2 cycles total:
+```bash
+cli-pomodoro -n 3 -c 2
+```
+
+No sound:
+```bash
+cli-pomodoro --no-sound
+```
+
+Quick focus session (15 min work, 3 min break):
+```bash
+cli-pomodoro -w 15 -s 3 -n 2 -c 1
+```
+
