+# daily-brief
+
+Daily briefing generator for tasks and events. Plan your day from the terminal with tasks, events, and weekly overviews.
+
+## Features
+
+- Add tasks with priority (low/medium/high) and categories
+- Add events with time and categories
+- Generate a daily brief with tasks and events summary
+- Mark tasks as done or cancelled
+- Weekly overview with progress bars
+- Filter tasks by status (pending, done, cancelled)
+- SQLite persistence in `~/.daily-brief/brief.db`
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/daily-brief@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/daily-brief.git
+cd daily-brief
+go build -o daily-brief .
+sudo mv daily-brief /usr/local/bin/
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+daily-brief brief [DATE]                          Show daily brief (default: today)
+daily-brief add-task <title> [OPTIONS]             Add a task
+daily-brief add-event <title> [OPTIONS]            Add an event
+daily-brief done <task-id>                         Mark task as done
+daily-brief cancel <task-id>                       Mark task as cancelled
+daily-brief remove <task|event> <id>               Remove a task or event
+daily-brief list [--status STATUS] [--date DATE]   List tasks
+daily-brief week                                   Show weekly overview
+```
+
+## Examples
+
+```bash
+# Add tasks
+daily-brief add-task "Review PR #42" --priority high --category work
+daily-brief add-task "Grocery shopping" --category personal
+daily-brief add-task "Write docs" --priority medium --date 2026-05-29
+
+# Add events
+daily-brief add-event "Team standup" --time 09:30 --category work
+daily-brief add-event "Dentist appointment" --time 14:00
+
+# Generate daily brief
+daily-brief brief
+daily-brief brief 2026-05-29
+
+# Mark task done
+daily-brief done 1
+
+# Weekly overview
+daily-brief week
+
+# List pending tasks
+daily-brief list --status pending
+```
+
+## License
+
+MIT
