+# git-repo-info
+
+Displays information about a git repository: branch, commits, authors, branches, remote URL, creation date, last commit, and .git directory size.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/git-repo-info@latest
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+git-repo-info [path]
+```
+
+### Examples
+
+```bash
+# Info about current directory
+git-repo-info
+
+# Info about specific repository
+git-repo-info /path/to/repo
+```
+
+### Output
+
+```
+Repository Info
+===============
+
+Path:          /path/to/repo
+Branch:        main
+HEAD:          a1b2c3d4e5f6
+Total commits: 142
+Remote:        git@github.com:user/repo.git
+Created:       2024-01-15 10:30:00 +0000
+Last commit:   a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0
+Last author:   John Doe <john@example.com>
+Size (.git):   4.2 MB
+
+Branches:
+  main
+  develop
+  feature/new-ui
+
+Top authors:
+  John Doe
+  Jane Smith
+  Bob Wilson
+```
+
+## License
+
+MIT
