+# cli-biography
+
+Quick biographical notes on people. Store and retrieve brief biographical info (name, birth, occupation, bio, tags) in a local JSON store with search and filtering.
+
+![Go](https://img.shields.io/badge/Go-1.21+-00ADD8?style=flat&logo=go)
+![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg)
+
+## Features
+
+- **Quick add** — interactive prompts for born, occupation, bio, tags
+- **Fuzzy search** — find people by name, occupation, bio text, or tags
+- **Tag system** — organize entries with tags, filter by tag
+- **Update & delete** — modify or remove existing entries
+- **JSON storage** — human-readable data in `~/.config/cli-biography/biography.json`
+
+## Install
+
+### From source
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/tatanesan/cli-biography@latest
+```
+
+### Build manually
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/cli-biography.git
+cd cli-biography
+go build -o cli-biography .
+sudo mv cli-biography /usr/local/bin/
+```
+
+## Requirements
+
+- Go 1.21+
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+cli-biography <command> [arguments]
+```
+
+### Commands
+
+| Command | Description |
+|---------|-------------|
+| `add <name>` | Add a new person (interactive) |
+| `list [tag]` | List all people, optionally filtered by tag |
+| `get <name>` | Show details for a person (fuzzy match) |
+| `update <name>` | Update a person's info (interactive) |
+| `delete <name>` | Delete a person's entry |
+| `search <q>` | Search by name, occupation, bio, or tags |
+| `tags` | List all tags |
+
+### Examples
+
+Add a person (interactive):
+```bash
+cli-biography add "Marie Curie"
+```
+
+List all entries:
+```bash
+cli-biography list
+```
+
+List entries with a specific tag:
+```bash
+cli-biography list scientist
+```
+
+Show details (fuzzy match):
+```bash
+cli-biography get "Curie"
+```
+
+Search across all fields:
+```bash
