+# project-log
+
+Project journal with milestones — track progress, log entries, and manage milestones for any project from the terminal.
+
+## Features
+
+- Create and manage multiple project journals
+- Add timestamped journal entries with tags
+- Define and track milestones
+- Filter entries by tag
+- View project statistics and activity
+- JSON-based storage in `~/.project-log/`
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+# From source
+go install github.com/TataneSan/project-log@latest
+
+# Or build manually
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/project-log.git
+cd project-log
+go build -o project-log .
+cp project-log /usr/local/bin/
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+project-log <command> [arguments]
+```
+
+### Commands
+
+| Command | Description |
+|---------|-------------|
+| `init <name> [-d description]` | Create a new project log |
+| `list` | List all projects |
+| `entry <project> <title>` | Add a journal entry |
+| `milestone <project> <title>` | Add a milestone |
+| `done <project> <index>` | Mark a milestone as completed |
+| `show <project>` | Show project log |
+| `stats <project>` | Show project statistics |
+| `delete <project>` | Delete a project |
+
+### Examples
+
+```bash
+# Create a project
+project-log init myapp -d "My awesome application"
+
+# Add a journal entry with tags
+project-log entry myapp "Fixed login bug" -m "Updated auth middleware" -t bug,auth
+
+# Add a milestone
+project-log milestone myapp "v1.0 Release" -d "First stable release"
+
+# Mark milestone as done
+project-log done myapp 0
+
+# View project
+project-log show myapp
+
+# Filter entries by tag
+project-log show myapp -t bug
+
+# View statistics
+project-log stats myapp
+
+# List all projects
+project-log list
+```
+
+## Entry Options
+
+- `-m`, `--content` — Entry content/description
+- `-t`, `--tags` — Comma-separated tags (e.g., `bug,auth,urgent`)
+
