+# idea-box
+
+A CLI idea box with tags and voting — capture, organize, and prioritize your ideas from the terminal.
+
+## Features
+
+- Create multiple idea boxes (work, personal, side-projects)
+- Add ideas with descriptions and tags
+- Upvote and downvote ideas
+- Filter ideas by tag
+- Sort by votes, newest, or oldest
+- View top voted ideas
+- JSON-based storage in `~/.idea-box/`
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+# From source
+go install github.com/TataneSan/idea-box@latest
+
+# Or build manually
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/idea-box.git
+cd idea-box
+go build -o idea-box .
+cp idea-box /usr/local/bin/
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+idea-box <command> [arguments]
+```
+
+### Commands
+
+| Command | Description |
+|---------|-------------|
+| `create <name>` | Create a new idea box |
+| `list` | List all idea boxes |
+| `add <box> <title>` | Add an idea |
+| `vote <box> <id-or-title>` | Upvote an idea |
+| `show <box>` | Show all ideas |
+| `top <box> [n]` | Show top N voted ideas |
+| `rm <box> <id-or-title>` | Delete an idea |
+| `delete <box>` | Delete an idea box |
+
+### Examples
+
+```bash
+# Create an idea box for work
+idea-box create work
+
+# Add ideas with tags
+idea-box add work "Dark mode UI" -d "Add dark mode support" -t feature,ui
+idea-box add work "API rate limiting" -t backend,security
+idea-box add work "User onboarding flow" -t feature,ux
+
+# Vote on ideas
+idea-box vote work "Dark mode UI"
+idea-box vote work "Dark mode UI"
+idea-box vote work "User onboarding flow"
+
+# Downvote
+idea-box vote work "API rate limiting" --down
+
+# Show ideas sorted by votes
+idea-box show work -s votes
+
+# Filter by tag
+idea-box show work -t feature
+
+# Show top 3 ideas
+idea-box top work 3
+
+# Remove an idea
+idea-box rm work 123456
+```
+
