+# skill-tracker
+
+CLI tool to track skills with levels (1-10) and log practice sessions. Built with Go and SQLite.
+
+## Features
+
+- **Add skills** with name, category, level, and notes
+- **Log practice sessions** with hours spent and optional notes
+- **Track progression** by updating skill levels over time
+- **View history** of practice sessions per skill
+- **Statistics** dashboard with level distribution and totals
+- **Export** skills data as JSON
+- **Filter** skills by category
+
+## Install
+
+### From source
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/skill-tracker@latest
+```
+
+### Build manually
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/skill-tracker.git
+cd skill-tracker
+go build -o skill-tracker .
+cp skill-tracker /usr/local/bin/
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+skill-tracker <command> [arguments]
+```
+
+### Commands
+
+| Command | Description |
+|---|---|
+| `add <name>` | Add a new skill to track |
+| `list` | List all tracked skills |
+| `level <name> <1-10>` | Update skill level |
+| `log <name> <hours>` | Log a practice session |
+| `history <name>` | Show practice history |
+| `stats` | Show overall statistics |
+| `delete <name>` | Remove a skill |
+| `export` | Export skills as JSON |
+
+### Examples
+
+```bash
+# Add skills
+skill-tracker add "Go Programming" --category programming --level 5
+skill-tracker add "Guitar" --category music --level 2
+skill-tracker add "Python" --category programming --level 7
+
+# Log practice
+skill-tracker log "Go Programming" 2.5 --notes "Built a CLI tool"
+skill-tracker log "Guitar" 1.0 --notes "Practiced scales"
+
+# Update level after improvement
+skill-tracker level "Guitar" 3
+
+# View all skills
+skill-tracker list
+
+# Filter by category
+skill-tracker list --category programming
+
+# View practice history
+skill-tracker history "Go Programming" --weeks 8
+
+# View statistics
+skill-tracker stats
+
+# Export data
