+# git-last-commit
+
+Display formatted information about the last commit in a Git repository.
+
+Supports detailed, compact, and JSON output formats.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/git-last-commit@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/git-last-commit.git
+cd git-last-commit
+go build -o git-last-commit .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+git-last-commit [flags] [directory]
+```
+
+## Flags
+
+| Flag          | Description                        |
+|---------------|------------------------------------|
+| `-c`, `--compact` | Compact one-line output          |
+| `-j`, `--json`    | Output as JSON                   |
+
+Default output is a detailed box-drawing format.
+
+## Examples
+
+Detailed output (default):
+```bash
+git-last-commit
+```
+
+Compact output:
+```bash
+git-last-commit -c
+```
+
+JSON output:
+```bash
+git-last-commit -j
+```
+
+Target a specific repository directory:
+```bash
+git-last-commit /path/to/repo
+```
+
+## Output
+
+### Detailed (default)
+```
+╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
+║                    Last Commit                          ║
+╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
+║  Hash:    a1b2c3d4e5f6...
+║  Short:   a1b2c3d
+║  Author:  Jane Doe <jane@example.com>
+║  Date:    2026-05-28 10:30:00 UTC
+║  Age:     2h 15m 30s ago
+╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
+║  Subject: feat: add user authentication
+╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
+║  Added login and registration endpoints
+╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
+```
+
+### Compact
+```
