+# Hash API
+
+REST API for hashing text and files. Supports MD5, SHA1, SHA256, SHA512, Adler32, and CRC32.
+
+## Features
+
+- Hash text from request body
+- Hash uploaded files (up to 10MB)
+- Multiple algorithms: md5, sha1, sha256, sha512, adler32, crc32
+- Zero external dependencies — pure Go standard library
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+# Run directly
+go run main.go
+
+# Build binary
+go build -o hash-api .
+./hash-api
+
+# Docker
+docker build -t hash-api .
+docker run -p 8080:8080 hash-api
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+The server starts on `:8080` by default.
+
+### Endpoints
+
+#### `POST /api/hash`
+
+Hash text from the request body.
+
+| Parameter | Type   | Default  | Description                        |
+|-----------|--------|----------|------------------------------------|
+| `algo`    | string | `sha256` | Algorithm: `md5`, `sha1`, `sha256`, `sha512`, `adler32`, `crc32` |
+
+#### `POST /api/hash/file`
+
+Hash an uploaded file (multipart form).
+
+| Field  | Type   | Required | Description                        |
+|--------|--------|----------|------------------------------------|
+| `file` | file   | yes      | File to hash (max 10MB)            |
+| `algo` | string | no       | Algorithm (default: `sha256`)      |
+
+#### `GET /api/algorithms`
+
+List supported algorithms.
+
+#### `GET /health`
+
+Health check.
+
+### Examples
+
+Hash text with SHA256:
+```bash
+curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/hash -d 'hello world'
+# {"algorithm":"sha256","hash":"b94d27b9934d3e08a52e52d7da7dabfac484efe37a5380ee9088f7ace2efcde9","input_len":11}
+```
+
+Hash text with MD5:
+```bash
+curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/hash?algo=md5 -d 'hello'
+# {"algorithm":"md5","hash":"5d41402abc4b2a76b9719d911017c592","input_len":5}
+```
+
+Hash uploaded file:
+```bash
+curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/hash/file?algo=sha256 -F file=@document.pdf
+# {"algorithm":"sha256","hash":"abc123...","filename":"document.pdf","size":102400}
+```
+
+List algorithms:
