+# recipe-cli
+
+Command-line recipe manager with JSON persistence.
+
+## Features
+
+- Add, list, get, and delete recipes
+- Search recipes by name, category, ingredients, or notes
+- Interactive mode for adding recipes (line-by-line ingredients and steps)
+- Category tracking and counts
+- Import/export recipes as JSON
+- Data stored in `~/.recipe-cli/recipes.json`
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/recipe-cli@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/recipe-cli.git
+cd recipe-cli
+go build -o recipe-cli .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+# Add a recipe
+recipe-cli add "Pasta Carbonara" --category "Main" --servings 4 \
+  --ingredients "spaghetti, eggs, parmesan, pancetta, black pepper" \
+  --steps "Boil pasta, Fry pancetta, Mix eggs and cheese, Combine all, Serve"
+
+# List all recipes
+recipe-cli list
+
+# Search recipes
+recipe-cli list pasta
+
+# Get a full recipe by ID
+recipe-cli get 1
+
+# Delete a recipe
+recipe-cli delete 1
+
+# Show categories
+recipe-cli categories
+
+# Add interactively
+recipe-cli new
+
+# Export recipes
+recipe-cli export backup.json
+
+# Import recipes
+recipe-cli import backup.json
+```
+
+## Example
+
+```bash
+$ recipe-cli add "Pasta Carbonara" --category "Main" --servings 4 \
+  --ingredients "spaghetti, eggs, parmesan, pancetta" \
+  --steps "Boil pasta, Fry pancetta, Mix eggs and cheese, Combine all"
+Added recipe #1: Pasta Carbonara
+
+$ recipe-cli list
+  ID    Name                           Category        Servings
+  -------------------------------------------------------------------
+  1     Pasta Carbonara                Main            4
+
+  1 recipe(s)
+
+$ recipe-cli get 1
+  ID:       1
+  Name:     Pasta Carbonara
