+# cli-bingo
+
+Generate Bingo cards and play in the terminal.
+
+## Features
+
+- Generate random Bingo cards (B-I-N-G-O format, 1-75)
+- Draw random numbers with letter calls (B 7, I 23, etc.)
+- Play a full game with multiple players
+- Automatic win detection (rows, columns, diagonals)
+- Free space in the center
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/cli-bingo@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/cli-bingo.git
+cd cli-bingo
+go build -o cli-bingo .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+# Generate 1 card
+cli-bingo card
+
+# Generate 4 cards
+cli-bingo card 4
+
+# Draw 5 random numbers
+cli-bingo draw
+
+# Draw 10 random numbers
+cli-bingo draw 10
+
+# Play a game with 4 players
+cli-bingo game
+
+# Play with 8 players
+cli-bingo game 8
+```
+
+## Example
+
+```bash
+$ cli-bingo card
+
++------+------+------+------+------+\n|  B  |  I  |  N  |  G  |  O  |
++------+------+------+------+------+\n|  6  | 23 | 32 | 47 | 62 |
+--------------------------------\n| 14 | 16 | 37 | 52 | 68 |
+--------------------------------\n| 15 | 27 | FREE | 54 | 74 |
+--------------------------------\n| 10 | 20 | 31 | 56 | 67 |
+--------------------------------\n| 11 | 28 | 43 | 55 | 70 |
++------+------+------+------+------+\n
+```
+
+## License
+
+MIT
