+# word-counter
+
+Count words, characters, and lines in files with history tracking.
+
+## Features
+
+- Count words, characters, and lines in any file
+- Read from stdin for piped input
+- History of all counts with timestamps
+- Filter history by filename
+- Clear history
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/word-counter@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/word-counter.git
+cd word-counter
+go build -o word-counter .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+# Count words in a file
+word-counter count document.txt
+
+# Count from stdin
+cat file.txt | word-counter stdin
+
+# Show history
+word-counter history
+
+# Filter history by filename
+word-counter history document
+
+# Clear history
+word-counter clear
+```
+
+## Example
+
+```bash
+$ word-counter count document.txt
+  File:   /home/user/document.txt
+  Words:  245
+  Chars:  1523
+  Lines:  18
+
+$ word-counter history
+  File                                Words    Chars    Lines    Date
+  -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+  /home/user/document.txt             245      1523     18       2026-05-28 10:30
+
+$ cat essay.md | word-counter stdin
+  Words:  1200
+  Chars:  7800
+  Lines:  95
+```
+
+## Data Storage
+
+History is stored in `~/.word-counter/history.json` as JSON.
+
+## License
+
+MIT
