+# cli-trivia
+
+General knowledge quiz in your terminal. 60 questions across 6 categories with score tracking and leaderboard.
+
+## Features
+
+- 60 questions across 6 categories: science, history, geography, literature, technology, nature
+- Difficulty filtering: easy, medium, hard
+- Configurable number of questions
+- Optional time limit per question
+- Persistent high score leaderboard
+- Player name support
+- No external dependencies
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/cli-trivia@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/cli-trivia.git
+cd cli-trivia
+go build -o cli-trivia .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+cli-trivia [OPTIONS]
+```
+
+### Options
+
+| Flag | Description |
+|------|-------------|
+| `-c, --category CAT` | Category: all, science, history, geography, literature, technology, nature |
+| `-d, --difficulty DIFF` | Difficulty: easy, medium, hard (default: all) |
+| `-n, --num N` | Number of questions (default: 10, max: 50) |
+| `-t, --time SECONDS` | Time limit per question in seconds (default: 0 = no limit) |
+| `-l, --leaderboard` | Show top scores |
+| `--categories` | List available categories |
+| `-v, --version` | Show version |
+| `--help` | Show help |
+
+### Examples
+
+Play a standard quiz (10 random questions):
+```bash
+cli-trivia
+```
+
+Play 5 science questions:
+```bash
+cli-trivia -c science -n 5
+```
+
+Play medium difficulty history questions:
+```bash
+cli-trivia -c history -d medium
+```
+
+Play 20 questions with 15-second time limit:
+```bash
+cli-trivia -n 20 -t 15
+```
+
+View leaderboard:
+```bash
+cli-trivia --leaderboard
+```
+
+## Categories
+
+| Category | Questions |
+|----------|-----------|
