+# json-minify
+
+Minify JSON files by removing unnecessary whitespace. Reads from files or stdin, outputs compact JSON.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/json-minify@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/json-minify.git
+cd json-minify
+go build -o json-minify .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+json-minify <file.json>              Minify a file in place
+json-minify <file1.json> <file2.json> Minify multiple files
+cat file.json | json-minify           Minify from stdin
+```
+
+## Examples
+
+Minify a file in place:
+```bash
+json-minify config.json
+```
+
+Minify multiple files:
+```bash
+json-minify data/*.json
+```
+
+Minify from stdin and redirect output:
+```bash
+cat api_response.json | json-minify > api_response.min.json
+```
+
+Minify from a pipe:
+```bash
+curl -s https://api.example.com/data | json-minify
+```
+
+## Features
+
+- In-place file modification with size reduction stats
+- Stdin/stdout piping support
+- Multiple file processing with summary report
+- Percentage reduction display
+- Zero dependencies
+
+## License
+
+MIT
