+# git-stash-cleanup
+
+List and clean up obsolete git stashes with ease.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/git-stash-cleanup@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/git-stash-cleanup.git
+cd git-stash-cleanup
+go build -o git-stash-cleanup .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+git-stash-cleanup list                  List all stashes
+git-stash-cleanup drop <index>          Drop a specific stash
+git-stash-cleanup drop-all              Drop all stashes
+git-stash-cleanup drop-old --days <N>   Drop stashes older than N days
+```
+
+## Commands
+
+| Command | Description |
+|---------|-------------|
+| `list` | List all stashes with index, age, and message |
+| `drop <index>` | Drop a specific stash by index |
+| `drop-all` | Drop all stashes (prompts for confirmation) |
+| `drop-old --days <N>` | Drop stashes older than N days |
+
+## Options
+
+| Flag | Description |
+|------|-------------|
+| `--days <N>` | Age threshold in days (for `drop-old`) |
+| `-y`, `--yes` | Skip confirmation prompts |
+| `-h`, `--help` | Show help message |
+
+## Examples
+
+List all stashes:
+```bash
+git-stash-cleanup list
+```
+
+Drop a specific stash:
+```bash
+git-stash-cleanup drop 0
+```
+
+Drop all stashes older than 30 days:
+```bash
+git-stash-cleanup drop-old --days 30
+```
+
+Drop all stashes without confirmation:
+```bash
+git-stash-cleanup drop-all -y
+```
+
+## Features
+
+- List stashes with index, relative age, and message
+- Drop individual stashes by index
+- Bulk drop all stashes with confirmation
+- Drop stashes older than a specified number of days
+- Works with any git repository
+
+## License
+
+MIT
