+# captcha-api
+
+Simple CAPTCHA generation and verification API.
+
+Supports text and math CAPTCHAs with PNG image generation. CAPTCHAs are stored in memory with automatic expiration.
+
+## Features
+
+- **Text CAPTCHAs** — Random alphanumeric characters with noise and distortion
+- **Math CAPTCHAs** — Simple arithmetic problems (addition, subtraction, multiplication)
+- **Image generation** — PNG images with noise lines, dots, and random colors
+- **Verification** — Case-insensitive text matching, exact math answer matching
+- **Auto-expiration** — CAPTCHAs expire after 5 minutes
+- **Health check** — `/health` endpoint for monitoring
+
+## Endpoints
+
+| Method | Path | Description |
+|--------|------|-------------|
+| GET/POST | `/captcha/text` | Generate a text CAPTCHA |
+| GET/POST | `/captcha/math` | Generate a math CAPTCHA |
+| POST | `/captcha/verify` | Verify a CAPTCHA answer |
+| GET | `/captcha/image?id=xxx` | Get CAPTCHA image as PNG |
+| GET | `/health` | Health check |
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/captcha-api@latest
+```
+
+Or build manually:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/captcha-api.git
+cd captcha-api
+go build -o captcha-api .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+# Start the server (defaults to port 8080)
+./captcha-api
+```
+
+### Generate a text CAPTCHA
+
+```bash
+curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/captcha/text
+```
+
+Response:
+```json
+{
+  "id": "abc123xyz",
+  "type": "text",
+  "image": "data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgo...",
+  "hint": "Type the characters you see",
+  "expiry_seconds": 300
+}
+```
+
+### Generate a math CAPTCHA
+
+```bash
+curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/captcha/math
+```
+
+Response:
+```json
+{
+  "id": "def456uvw",
+  "type": "math",
+  "image": "data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgo...",
+  "hint": "Solve the math problem",
+  "expiry_seconds": 300
+}
