+# seed-api
+
+Reproducible random generation API with seed support.
+
+Generates deterministic random data (numbers, strings, arrays, booleans) based on a seed value. Same seed always produces the same result.
+
+## Features
+
+- **Random integers** — Configurable min/max range
+- **Random floats** — Configurable min/max range
+- **Random strings** — Multiple charsets (hex, alphanumeric, printable, etc.)
+- **Random arrays** — Arrays of random integers
+- **Random boolean** — True/false with seed
+- **Shuffle** — Deterministic array shuffling
+- **Choice** — Pick random item from a list
+- **Reproducible** — Same seed always returns the same result
+
+## Endpoints
+
+| Method | Path | Description |
+|--------|------|-------------|
+| GET | `/random/int?seed=xxx&min=0&max=100` | Random integer |
+| GET | `/random/float?seed=xxx&min=0&max=1` | Random float |
+| GET | `/random/string?seed=xxx&length=16&charset=alphanumeric` | Random string |
+| GET | `/random/array?seed=xxx&count=10&min=1&max=100` | Random integer array |
+| GET | `/random/bool?seed=xxx` | Random boolean |
+| GET | `/random/shuffle?seed=xxx&data=a,b,c,d` | Shuffle array |
+| GET | `/random/choice?seed=xxx&data=a,b,c,d` | Random choice |
+| GET | `/health` | Health check |
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/seed-api@latest
+```
+
+Or build manually:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/seed-api.git
+cd seed-api
+go build -o seed-api .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+# Start the server (defaults to port 8080)
+./seed-api
+```
+
+### Random integer
+
+```bash
+curl "http://localhost:8080/random/int?seed=test&min=1&max=50"
+```
+
+Response:
+```json
+{"seed": "test", "type": "int", "result": 37}
+```
+
+### Random float
+
+```bash
+curl "http://localhost:8080/random/float?seed=price&min=9.99&max=99.99"
+```
+
+Response:
+```json
+{"seed": "price", "type": "float", "result": 42.73}
+```
+
+### Random string
+
+```bash
+curl "http://localhost:8080/random/string?seed=tokengen&length=32&charset=hex"
+```
