+# git-reflog-clean
+
+A CLI tool to inspect and clean up git reflog entries to reduce repository size.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/git-reflog-clean@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/git-reflog-clean.git
+cd git-reflog-clean
+go build -o git-reflog-clean .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+git-reflog-clean list   [flags]    List current reflog entries
+git-reflog-clean clean   [flags]    Expire old reflog entries
+```
+
+### List reflog entries
+
+```bash
+git-reflog-clean list
+git-reflog-clean list --max 50
+```
+
+### Clean reflog entries
+
+```bash
+# Dry run — see what would be removed
+git-reflog-clean clean --dry-run
+
+# Expire entries older than 30 days
+git-reflog-clean clean --expire 30
+
+# Expire ALL unreachable entries immediately
+git-reflog-clean clean --all
+```
+
+### Flags
+
+| Flag | Command | Default | Description |
+|------|---------|---------|-------------|
+| `--max` | list | 20 | Maximum entries to show |
+| `--dry-run` | clean | false | Show what would be cleaned without doing it |
+| `--expire` | clean | 90 | Expire entries older than N days |
+| `--all` | clean | false | Expire all unreachable entries immediately |
+
+## Examples
+
+### Check current reflog size
+
+```bash
+$ git-reflog-clean list
+
+============================================================
+  Git Reflog
+============================================================
+
+  --- Summary ---
+  Total reflog entries: 1523
+
+  --- Recent Entries (last 20) ---
+  [1523] refs/heads/main | commit: Merge pull request #42
+  [1522] refs/heads/main | commit: fix: handle edge case
+  [1521] refs/stash@{0} | commit (Stash): WIP on main
+```
+
+### Dry run before cleaning
+
+```bash
+$ git-reflog-clean clean --dry-run --expire 30
