+# symlink-manager
+
+A CLI tool to manage symbolic links — create, list, verify, find broken links, and remove them.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/symlink-manager@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/symlink-manager.git
+cd symlink-manager
+go build -o symlink-manager .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+symlink-manager create <target> <link>     Create a symlink
+symlink-manager list [directory]           List symlinks in directory
+symlink-manager verify [directory]         Verify symlinks are valid
+symlink-manager broken [directory]         Find broken symlinks
+symlink-manager remove <link> [link...]    Remove symlinks
+```
+
+### Create a symlink
+
+```bash
+symlink-manager create /usr/local/bin/app ./bin/app
+```
+
+### List symlinks in a directory
+
+```bash
+symlink-manager list /etc
+symlink-manager list  # current directory
+```
+
+### Verify symlinks
+
+```bash
+symlink-manager verify /home/user/projects
+```
+
+Shows `[OK]` for valid links and `[BROKEN]` for broken ones.
+
+### Find broken symlinks
+
+```bash
+symlink-manager broken /home/user/projects
+```
+
+### Remove symlinks
+
+```bash
+symlink-manager remove ./old-link ./another-link
+```
+
+## Examples
+
+```bash
+$ symlink-manager list .
+
+============================================================
+  Symbolic Links
+============================================================
+
+  [ 1] ./bin/app                          -> /usr/local/bin/app
+  [ 2] ./config/dev                       -> /etc/app/dev.conf
+  [ 3] ./old-link                         -> /tmp/removed
+       Status: BROKEN
+
+  --- Summary ---
+  Total symlinks: 3
+  Scanned files: 42
