+# cli-bookmarks
+
+A CLI tool to manage bookmarks and shortcuts from the terminal. Save URLs with tags and notes, then quickly retrieve them.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/cli-bookmarks@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/cli-bookmarks.git
+cd cli-bookmarks
+go build -o cli-bookmarks .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+cli-bookmarks add <name> <url> [--tag TAG] [--notes NOTES]  Add a bookmark
+cli-bookmarks list [--tag TAG]                               List bookmarks
+cli-bookmarks get <name>                                     Get a bookmark URL
+cli-bookmarks remove <name>                                  Remove a bookmark
+cli-bookmarks tags                                           List all tags
+```
+
+### Add a bookmark
+
+```bash
+cli-bookmarks add github https://github.com --tag dev
+cli-bookmarks add docs "https://docs.example.com" --tag work --notes "API docs"
+```
+
+### List bookmarks
+
+```bash
+cli-bookmarks list
+cli-bookmarks list --tag dev
+```
+
+### Get a bookmark URL
+
+```bash
+cli-bookmarks get github
+# Output: https://github.com
+```
+
+### Remove a bookmark
+
+```bash
+cli-bookmarks remove docs
+```
+
+### List tags
+
+```bash
+cli-bookmarks tags
+```
+
+## Examples
+
+```bash
+$ cli-bookmarks add github https://github.com --tag dev
+Added: github -> https://github.com
+  Tag: dev
+
+$ cli-bookmarks add stackoverflow https://stackoverflow.com --tag dev --notes "Q&A"
+Added: stackoverflow -> https://stackoverflow.com
+  Tag: dev
+  Notes: Q&A
+
+$ cli-bookmarks list
+
+============================================================
+  Bookmarks
+============================================================
