+# git-file-tree
+
+Display modified files in a tree structure for any git commit or revision.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/git-file-tree@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/git-file-tree.git
+cd git-file-tree
+go build -o git-file-tree .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+git-file-tree [OPTIONS] [REVISION]
+```
+
+### Options
+
+| Flag | Description |
+|------|-------------|
+| `-s, --status` | Show file status (M=modified, A=added, D=deleted, etc.) |
+| `-f, --flat` | Flat output (no indentation) |
+| `-S, --staged` | Show staged files instead of commit |
+| `-u, --untracked` | Include untracked files |
+| `-c, --no-color` | Disable colors |
+| `-h, --help` | Show help message |
+
+### Arguments
+
+- **REVISION** — Git revision (commit hash, branch, tag, etc.). Default: HEAD
+
+## Examples
+
+### Show files in last commit
+
+```bash
+git-file-tree
+```
+
+### Show files with status
+
+```bash
+git-file-tree -s HEAD
+```
+
+Output:
+```
+e747342 feat: recursive JSON key renamer with regex support
+----------------------------------------
+ [A] .gitignore
+ [A] LICENSE
+ [A] README.md
+ [A] go.mod
+ [A] main.go
+
+5 files changed
+```
+
+### Show staged files
+
+```bash
+git-file-tree --staged
+```
+
+### Compare branches
+
+```bash
+git-file-tree -s main...feature-branch
+```
+
