+# git-history
+
+Formatted git history viewer with commit stats, author filtering, and multiple output formats.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/git-history@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/git-history.git
+cd git-history
+go build -o git-history .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+git-history [options]
+```
+
+Run from within a git repository.
+
+### Options
+
+| Flag | Description |
+|------|-------------|
+| `-n, --max NUM` | Max commits to show (default: 30) |
+| `-a, --author NAME` | Filter by author |
+| `-s, --since DATE` | Filter by date (e.g. '1 week ago') |
+| `-f, --format FMT` | Output format: oneline, detailed, stats |
+| `--stats` | Show summary statistics |
+| `-h, --help` | Show help message |
+
+## Formats
+
+### Oneline
+
+Compact one-line per commit:
+
+```bash
+git-history -f oneline -n 5
+```
+
+### Detailed
+
+Detailed view with dates and line change stats:
+
+```bash
+git-history -f detailed -n 10
+```
+
+### Stats
+
+Summary statistics with author breakdown:
+
+```bash
+git-history --stats
+```
+
+## Examples
+
+```bash
+git-history                              # Last 30 commits
+git-history -n 10                        # Last 10 commits
+git-history -a Alice                     # Commits by Alice
+git-history -s '1 month ago'             # Last month
+git-history --stats                      # Summary statistics
+git-history -f detailed -n 20            # Detailed, 20 commits
+```
+
+## License
+
+MIT
