 # dir-compare
 
-CLI tool to compare the contents of two directories. Supports hash-based comparison and directory ignoring.
+Fast directory comparison tool in Go. Compares two directories file-by-file using SHA-256 hashes and reports differences.
+
+## Features
+
+- File-by-file comparison using SHA-256 hashing
+- Detects files only in directory A, only in directory B, and modified files
+- Verbose mode with size difference details
+- Recursive directory traversal
+- Exit code 0 if identical, 1 if differences found (useful in CI/scripts)
+- Single binary, no dependencies
 
