+# git-author-stats
+
+Display contributor statistics for a Git repository.
+
+## Features
+
+- Commits per author
+- Files touched per author
+- Lines inserted/deleted per author
+- Sorted by commit count
+- Total summary row
+- Single binary, no dependencies
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/git-author-stats@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/git-author-stats.git
+cd git-author-stats
+go build -o git-author-stats .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+git-author-stats [repo-path]
+```
+
+Defaults to current directory if no path provided.
+
+### Examples
+
+Current repository:
+```bash
+git-author-stats
+```
+
+Specific repository:
+```bash
+git-author-stats /path/to/repo
+```
+
+### Output
+
+```
