+# git-branch-age
+
+Show the age of each git branch, sorted by last commit date.
+
+```
+BRANCH  AGE     AUTHOR     HASH  SUBJECT
+----  ------  ---------  ----  -------
+main    1h ago  John      a1b2c3  feat: add new feature
+dev     3d ago  Jane      d4e5f6  fix: resolve bug
+```
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/git-branch-age@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/git-branch-age.git
+cd git-branch-age
+go build -o git-branch-age .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+git-branch-age [flags]
+```
+
+### Flags
+
+| Flag | Default | Description |
+|------|---------|-------------|
+| `-a` | | Show all branches (local + remote) |
+| `-r` | | Show only remote branches |
+| `-l` | | Show only local branches |
+| `-j` | | Output as JSON |
+| `-n` | `0` | Limit output to N branches (0 = all) |
+
+## Examples
+
+### Show local branches
+
+```bash
+git-branch-age
+```
+
+### Show all branches including remote
+
+```bash
+git-branch-age -a
+```
+
+### Show 5 newest branches
+
+```bash
+git-branch-age -n 5
+```
+
+### JSON output
+
+```bash
+git-branch-age -j
+```
+
+Output:
+```json
+[
+  {"name":"main", "hash":"a1b2c3", "subject":"feat: add feature", "author":"John", "date":"2026-05-28T10:00:00Z", "age_seconds":3600, "remote":false},
+  {"name":"dev", "hash":"d4e5f6", "subject":"fix: resolve bug", "author":"Jane", "date":"2026-05-25T10:00:00Z", "age_seconds":259200, "remote":false}
+]
+```
+
+### Show only remote branches
+
+```bash
