+# yaml-to-csv
+
+Convert YAML to CSV.
+
+```bash
+cat data.yaml | yaml-to-csv
+name,age,city
+Alice,30,Paris
+Bob,25,London
+```
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/yaml-to-csv@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/yaml-to-csv.git
+cd yaml-to-csv
+go build -o yaml-to-csv .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+yaml-to-csv [flags]
+```
+
+### Flags
+
+| Flag | Default | Description |
+|------|---------|-------------|
+| `-f` | | Input file (default: stdin) |
+| `-o` | | Output file (default: stdout) |
+| `-d` | `,` | Field delimiter |
+
+## Examples
+
+### Basic conversion
+
+```bash
+cat data.yaml | yaml-to-csv
+```
+
+Input (YAML):
+```yaml
+- name: Alice
+  age: 30
+  city: Paris
+- name: Bob
+  age: 25
+  city: London
+```
+
+Output (CSV):
+```
+name,age,city
+Alice,30,Paris
+Bob,25,London
+```
+
+### Nested objects
+
+Nested objects are flattened with dot notation:
+
+```yaml
+- user:
+    name: Alice
+    address:
+      city: Paris
+```
+
+Output:
+```
+user.name,user.address.city
