+# csv-count
+
+Count rows in CSV files from the command line.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/csv-count@latest
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+csv-count [flags] [file.csv ...]
+```
+
+## Flags
+
+| Flag | Default | Description |
+|------|---------|-------------|
+| `-d` | `,` | Field delimiter |
+
+## Examples
+
+Count rows from stdin:
+```bash
+cat data.csv | csv-count
+```
+
+Count rows in a file:
+```bash
+csv-count data.csv
+```
+
+Count rows in multiple files:
+```bash
+csv-count file1.csv file2.csv file3.csv
+```
+
+Count TSV rows:
+```bash
+csv-count -d $'\t' data.tsv
+```
+
