+# git-repo-size
+
+Show git repository size breakdown. Analyze what's taking space in your .git directory and working tree.
+
+## Features
+
+- Total repository and working tree size
+- Top N largest blobs
+- Per-branch size breakdown
+- Human-readable size formatting
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/git-repo-size@latest
+```
+
+Or build locally:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/git-repo-size.git
+cd git-repo-size
+go build -o git-repo-size .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+# Show default report (top 10 blobs)
+git-repo-size
+
+# Show top 20 largest files
+git-repo-size -t 20
+
+# Include branch sizes
+git-repo-size -b
+
+# Both options
+git-repo-size -t 15 -b
+```
+
+## Examples
+
+```bash
+# Check what's bloating your repo
+git-repo-size
+
+# Find the largest files
+git-repo-size -t 5
+
+# Compare branch sizes
+git-repo-size -b
+```
+
+## License
+
+MIT
