+# json-to-tsv
+
+Convert JSON arrays to TSV (tab-separated values) format.
+
+## Features
+
+- Converts JSON arrays of objects to TSV
+- Auto-detects all keys across objects
+- Handles nested objects (JSON-encoded)
+- Includes header row by default
+- Reads from file or stdin
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/json-to-tsv@latest
+```
+
+Or build locally:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/json-to-tsv.git
+cd json-to-tsv
+go build -o json-to-tsv .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+# From file
+json-to-tsv -f data.json
+
+# From stdin
+cat data.json | json-to-tsv
+
+# Without header
+json-to-tsv -H=false -f data.json
+```
+
+## Examples
+
+```bash
+# Convert and pipe to CSV tool
+json-to-tsv -f data.json | column -t -s$'\t'
+
+# Convert API response
+curl https://api.example.com/items | json-to-tsv
+```
+
+## License
