+# toml-to-csv
+
+Convert TOML files to CSV from the command line.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/toml-to-csv@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/toml-to-csv.git
+cd toml-to-csv
+go build -o toml-to-csv .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+toml-to-csv [FILE]
+```
+
+Reads from stdin if no file is provided.
+
+## Examples
+
+```bash
+# Convert a TOML file
+toml-to-csv config.toml
+
+# Via stdin
+cat config.toml | toml-to-csv
+
+# Redirect output
+toml-to-csv < config.toml > output.csv
+```
+
+## Features
+
+- Parses TOML sections as CSV headers
+- Handles arrays of tables
+- Top-level key-value pairs written as rows
+- Supports all TOML value types (string, int, float, bool)
+
+## License
+
+MIT
