+# git-tag-info
+
+Display detailed information about git tags from the command line.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/git-tag-info@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/git-tag-info.git
+cd git-tag-info
+go build -o git-tag-info .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+git-tag-info [flags] [tag-name]
+```
+
+## Flags
+
+| Flag | Description | Default |
+|------|-------------|---------|
+| `[tag-name]` | Show details for a specific tag (list all if omitted) | all |
+| `--format, -f` | Output format: `text`, `table`, `json` | `text` |
+| `--sort, -s` | Sort by: `name`, `date`, `author` | `date` |
+| `--verbose` | Show extra details (full SHA, newer tag count) | off |
+| `--repo PATH` | Path to git repository | current dir |
+| `-v, --version` | Show version | — |
+| `-h, --help` | Show help | — |
+
+## Examples
+
+### List all tags
+
+```bash
+git-tag-info
+```
+
+```
+v0.2.0               a1b2c3d (annotated) - 2026-05-28 10:30:00 UTC
+  Release v0.2.0
+v0.1.0               e4f5g6h (annotated) - 2026-05-20 09:00:00 UTC
+  Initial release
+```
+
+### Show details for a specific tag
+
+```bash
+git-tag-info v1.0.0
+```
+
+```
+Tag:       v1.0.0
+Type:      annotated
+Commit:    a1b2c3d (Release v1.0.0)
+Author:    Jane Doe <jane@example.com>
+Date:      2026-05-28 10:30:00 UTC
+Tagger:    Jane Doe
+Tag Date:  2026-05-28 10:30:00 UTC
+```
+
+### Table format
+
+```bash
+git-tag-info --format table
+```
+
+```
+TAG                       TYPE    COMMIT                                   AUTHOR               DATE
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+v0.2.0                    annot   a1b2c3d                                  Jane Doe <jane@example.com> 2026-05-28 10:30:00 UTC
+v0.1.0                    annot   e4f5g6h                                  Jane Doe <jane@example.com> 2026-05-20 09:00:00 UTC
