+# csv-head
+
+Display the first N lines of a CSV file.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/csv-head@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/csv-head.git
+cd csv-head
+go build -o csv-head .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+csv-head <file> [n]
+```
+
+Defaults to 10 lines if `n` is omitted.
+
+## Examples
+
+```bash
+$ csv-head data.csv 5
+name,age,city
+Alice,30,Paris
+Bob,25,Lyon
+Charlie,35,Marseille
+Diana,28,Nice
+
+$ csv-head data.csv
+name,age,city
+Alice,30,Paris
+Bob,25,Lyon
+(2 lines shown)
+```
+
