+# git-diff-files
+
+List files modified between two git commits.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/git-diff-files@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/git-diff-files.git
+cd git-diff-files
+go build -o git-diff-files .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+git-diff-files <ref>
+git-diff-files <left> <right>
+```
+
+## Examples
+
+```bash
+$ git-diff-files HEAD
+[A] new-feature.go
+[M] main.go
+[D] old-file.txt
+
+$ git-diff-files main feature-branch
+[A] feature.go
+[M] config.yaml
+
+$ git-diff-files HEAD~3 HEAD
+[M] main.go
+[M] README.md
+```
+
+## Output
+
+- `[A]` Added file
+- `[M]` Modified file
+- `[D]` Deleted file
+- `[R]` Renamed file
+
+## License
+
+MIT
