+# toml-lint
+
+Check TOML syntax and style.
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install github.com/TataneSan/toml-lint@latest
+```
+
+Or build from source:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/toml-lint.git
+cd toml-lint
+go build -o toml-lint .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+toml-lint <file.toml>
+```
+
+## Examples
+
+```bash
+$ toml-lint config.toml
+OK
+
+$ toml-lint broken.toml
+broken.toml:3: syntax: expected key = value pair
+
+1 issue(s) found
+```
+
+## Output
+
