+
+### Options
+
+| Flag | Description |
+|------|-------------|
+| `-s` | Sort output alphabetically |
+| `-r` | Reverse sort order |
+| `-f PREFIX` | Filter keys by prefix |
+| `-format FORMAT` | Output format: `table`, `key=value`, `json` (default: `table`) |
+| `-k` | Show only keys |
+| `-c` | Show count of variables |
 
