 # file-age
 
-Display the age of files (modification time).
+Display file ages (time since last modification) in a clean terminal format.
+
+## Features
+
+- Show file modification age in human-readable format
+- Sort by oldest (`-s`) or newest (`-n`)
+- Recursive directory traversal (`-r`)
+- Filter files older than a duration (`-older 2d`)
+- Output formats: `table` (default), `json`, `csv`
+- Compact age display: seconds, minutes, hours, days, weeks, months
 
 ## Install
 
 ```bash
-go install github.com/TataneSan/file-age@latest
+go install ./...
 ```
 
-Or build from source:
+Or build directly:
 
 ```bash
-git clone https://github.com/TataneSan/file-age.git
-cd file-age
 go build -o file-age .
 ```
 
 ## Usage
 
 ```
-file-age <path> [path2 ...]
+file-age [options] [paths...]
 ```
+
+### Options
+
+| Flag | Description |
+|------|-------------|
+| `-s` | Sort by age (oldest first) |
+| `-n` | Sort by age (newest first) |
+| `-h` | Human-readable age (e.g. 2h, 3d, 1w) |
+| `-r` | Recurse into subdirectories |
+| `-format FORMAT` | Output format: `table`, `json`, `csv` (default: `table`) |
+| `-older DURATION` | Show only files older than duration (e.g. 2h, 3d, 1w, 30m) |
+
+### Duration formats
+
+Supports Go-style durations (`30s`, `5m`, `2h`) plus shorthand for longer periods:
+- `3d` — 3 days
+- `1w` — 1 week
+- `6M` — 6 months
+- `1y` — 1 year
+
+Defaults to current directory (`.`) if no path is given.
 
 ## Examples
 
+Show files in current directory, newest first:
 ```bash
-$ file-age main.go
-main.go                                  modified 5m ago (2.1 KB)
+./file-age -n .
+```
 
-$ file-age *.go
-main.go                                  modified 5m ago (2.1 KB)
-utils.go                                 modified 2h ago (1.5 KB)
+Show files with human-readable ages:
+```bash
+./file-age -h .
+```
 
-$ file-age /var/log/syslog /tmp/test.csv
-syslog                                   modified 30s ago (1.2 MB)
-test.csv                                 modified 2d ago (76 B)
