 Generate a JSON Schema from a JSON file.
 
+## Features
+
+- Infer JSON Schema types from sample data
+- Recursive object and array type inference
+- Detect required fields from object keys
+- Support for nested objects and arrays
+- Title and description metadata injection
+- Strict mode for single-type array items
+
 ## Install
 
 ```bash
-go install github.com/TataneSan/json-schema-gen@latest
+go install ./...
