 ```
 
 ## Usage
 
 ```
-json-schema-gen <file.json>
+json-schema-gen [options] <file.json>
 ```
+
+### Options
+
+| Flag | Description |
+|------|-------------|
+| `-h, --help` | Show help message |
+| `-t, --title TITLE` | Set the schema title |
+| `-d, --description D` | Set the schema description |
+| `-s, --strict` | Use strict type inference (first element only for arrays) |
 
