+# yaml-to-toml
+
+Convert YAML files to TOML format.
+
+## Features
+
+- Parse YAML and output valid TOML
+- Support for nested mappings, arrays, and primitive types
+- Automatic type detection (strings, integers, floats, booleans)
+- Read from file or stdin
+- Sorted keys for deterministic output
+
+## Install
+
+```bash
+go install ./...
+```
+
+Or build directly:
+
+```bash
+go build -o yaml-to-toml .
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+yaml-to-toml [file.yml]
+```
+
+Reads from stdin if no file is provided.
+
+## Examples
+
+Convert a YAML file:
+```bash
+./yaml-to-toml config.yml
+```
+
+Read from stdin:
+```bash
+cat config.yml | ./yaml-to-toml
+```
+
+## Input format
+
+Standard YAML:
+```yaml
+database:
+  host: localhost
+  port: 5432
+  enabled: true
+
+logging:
+  level: debug
+  outputs:
+    - stdout
+    - file
+```
+
+## Output format
+
+TOML:
+```toml
+[database]
+enabled = true
+host = "localhost"
+port = 5432
+
+[logging]
+level = "debug"
+outputs = ["stdout", "file"]
+```
+
+## License
+
+MIT
